---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" alternate="/privacy">
 <div class="container-page page-enter" style="padding-top:64px; padding-bottom:48px;">
  <header style="margin-bottom:40px; padding-bottom:32px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink); max-width:var(--readable);">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Legal</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px); letter-spacing:-0.025em; font-weight:400;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--ink-3); margin-top:8px; font-size:13px; font-family: var(--mono); letter-spacing:0.04em;">Last updated: 2026-10-29</p>
  </header>

  <div class="prose max-w-none">
    <p><em>This is a translation provided for convenience. The <a href="/privacy">Korean version</a> is the governing text.</em></p>

    <h2>1. Information collected</h2>
    <p>This site does not require registration and does not collect personal information directly from users. The following information may, however, be collected and processed automatically.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>IP address, browser type, operating system and time of visit</li>
      <li>Requested page address and previous page address (referrer)</li>
      <li>RSS client information when subscribing via RSS</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Purposes</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Providing and operating the service, and analyzing access statistics</li>
      <li>Responding to errors and security threats</li>
      <li>(If advertising is introduced) serving advertisements and measuring their effectiveness</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Retention and deletion</h2>
    <p>This site does not store information that identifies users, such as member information. Automatically collected access logs (including IP addresses) are stored in the Amazon Web Services Seoul region and are <strong>deleted automatically after 35 days</strong>. Access statistics are kept only as aggregates derived from those logs (such as visits per page and per day), excluding IP addresses and other identifying information.</p>

    <h2>4. Processors and third-party tools</h2>
    <p>The following services are, or may in future be, used for operation or analysis. Each follows its own privacy policy.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Amazon Web Services</strong> — hosting and content delivery (EC2, CloudFront), access log storage (S3)</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense / Kakao AdFit</strong> — advertising (separate notice when introduced)</li>
      <li><strong>TradingView</strong> — embedded chart widgets</li>
      <li><strong>Unsplash</strong> — image hosting</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses its own cookies and local storage to improve the user experience, such as remembering the theme (dark mode) setting. Access statistics are compiled only from server access logs, without cookies or tracking scripts. If advertising is introduced, ad networks may use separate cookies to process behavioral information, and a separate consent procedure will be provided at that time.</p>

    <h2>6. Children under 14</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 14 and does not offer registration or collect personal information directly.</p>

    <h2>7. Your rights and how to exercise them</h2>
    <p>You may exercise the following rights regarding the processing of your personal information.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Request access to how it is processed</li>
      <li>Request correction of errors</li>
      <li>Request deletion</li>
      <li>Request suspension of processing</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Requests may be made in writing or by email to <a href="mailto:nicepark0606@gmail.com">nicepark0606@gmail.com</a>, and we will act within a reasonable period.</p>

    <h2>8. Privacy officer</h2>
    <p>For inquiries and complaints regarding personal information, contact:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:nicepark0606@gmail.com">nicepark0606@gmail.com</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>9. Changes</h2>
    <p>This policy may be revised as laws or operations change. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</Base>
